  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hit hwa gedon hæbbe, beo he utlah wið God ⁊ amansumod fram eallum Cristendome ⁊ wið þone cyning scyldig ealles þæs þe he age, buton he ðe raðor geswice ⁊ þe deopplicor gebete wið God.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone has done so, he shall be an outcast before God and cut off from the whole community of Christians, and he shall forfeit to the king all that he has, unless he desists [from the unhallowed wedlock] as quickly as possible, and makes amends towards God to the utmost.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
